8. Government Regulation Number 4 of 2006 concerning the Implementation and Cooperation for the Recovery of Victims of Domestic Violence (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2006 Number 15, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 4604);
9. Government Regulation Number 59 of 2019 concerning the Implementation of Coordination of Child Protection (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2019 Number 160, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 6382);
10. Regulation of the Minister of Women's Empowerment Number 1 of 2010 concerning Minimum Service Standards for Integrated Services for Women and Children Victims of Violence (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2010 Number 483);
11. Regulation of the State Minister for Women's Empowerment and Child Protection Number 15 of 2010 concerning General Guidelines for Handling Children in Conflict with the Law (State News of the Republic of Indonesia of 2010 Number 483);
